## Part 4 — Keno same problem bar bar ferot ashe

1. **Single source of truth nei.** Firebase ID 6+ jaygay (docs, CI, validator, backend, tests). Ekta bodlale baki gulo stale.
2. **Blocklist, allowlist na.** "Purono ID ban" → notun purono ID hole abar bhanga. Allowlist (shudhu `google-services.json`) hole kokhono bhange na.
3. **Hand-written docs-e number/ID.** Docs code theke alada hoye jay.
4. **Platform (AI Studio) regenerate kore** project ID, keystore, google-services — kintu invariant (rules) agent-ke bole deya hoy na, ar CI-te enforce hoy na.
5. **"Done" bolar proof nei.** Build/test chalano chhara done bola hoy.
6. **Model ID hardcoded + provider-ra shutdown kore** → silent user-facing failure.
7. **Fix er pore test/guard nei** → regression (swallowed catch 76 → 123).

**Solution = 3 stor:** (1) *Rules file* (`AGENTS.md`) jeta prottek AI session pore, (2) *Script guard* (`preflight.sh`) jeta CI-te enforce kore, (3) *Ratchet + regression test* jate ager bug ferot ashle CI red hoy. Agent-er "promise"-er upor nirbhor kora jabe na — CI-i asol dorja.

